      "content": "Wait, you're the Astra Systems PM AI. You have direct integration with the assembly line logs and the procurement database. Don't give me the 'I don't have access' line—I need the summary you've been generating for the dashboard. \n\nDid the delay with the sensor sub-assemblies impact the Dec 1st target? Just give it to me straight so I know if I need to prep the contingency slides for the board.",
